      "side": 1,
      "message": "Then that would imply the access from DSM#setSignalStrengthReportingCriteria is happening on a different thread 100% of the time, right?\n\nAlso what about future changes? It\u0027s very easy to mistakenly add a concurrency error in some CL much later (T?) and not notice it until it starts crashing and we can only fix via QPR or something. If anything I think the @GuardedBy should be un-commented and enforced where it\u0027s not already enforced.",
